        <mj-text font-weight="bold" font-size="20px" color="#005C84" font-family="Roboto">Greetings from Digital Preservation Southampton</mj-text>

      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Welcome -->
    <mj-section padding="0px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-family="Roboto" align=left>
          We hope you are doing very well. This summer, the Digital Preservation Southampton team has been hard at work updating and delivering our training offers, meeting with valuable partners in the sector, and disseminating our work to the larger public. Here are some of our latest news and events.    </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Welcome Image -->
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="https://github.com/Southampton-Digital-Humanities/dps-mail/blob/main/assets/welcomeimage.jpg?raw=true" alt="Two people studying" width="593px" />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Upcoming Events -->
    <mj-section padding="10px 20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text font-size="20px" font-family="Roboto" font-weight="bold">Upcoming Events</mj-text>

        <!-- Workshop 1 -->
        
        <mj-text font-family="Roboto" font-size="16px" font-weight="bold" padding-top="16px">September Mastering Metadata Workshop</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-family="Roboto">
          Registrations for the September edition of our popular <em>Mastering Metadata for Digital Preservation</em> online workshop are officially open. Do not miss your chance! 
          <br /><br />
          <strong>September 5, 2025</strong><br />
          12pm-4:30pm BST (<a href="https://www.timeanddate.com/worldclock/converter.html?iso=20250905T110000&p1=136">See in your timezone</a>)<br />
          Location: Online<br />
          <a href="https://store.southampton.ac.uk/short-courses/faculty-of-arts-and-humanities/digital-preservation-advisory-unit/mastering-metadata-for-digital-preservation">Register Here</a>
          <br /><br />
          <strong>Are there discounted places available?</strong> 
          <br /><br />
          Yes, we are able to evaluate cases for discounted places, particularly for participants from Official Development Assistance (ODA) countries. Please email us describing your situation and we will offer you a discounted ticket. 
        </mj-text>
        <mj-image src="https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E22AQGqdxsEBR2vnw/feedshare-shrink_800/B4EZgxnlvkHoAo-/0/1753179119371?e=1756339200&v=beta&t=HFkWHvjYMTsS7wrTilCvaUVT-Iz7GalGToFRdj9MjDU" width="593px" />
        
        
        <!-- Upcoming Workshops Table -->
        <mj-text font-size="16px" font-family="Roboto" font-weight="bold">Other Upcoming Workshops</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-family="Roboto">
        Get excited! Below, you will find our current plan for upcoming workshops for the remainder of the year. We will promptly notify you once registrations open and dates are solidified. If any of these offerings particularly resonate with you, or you want to know more about them, please do reach out to us, and we will make sure to take your scheduling and content preferences into consideration.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-table font-family="Roboto" font-size="14px" cellpadding="10px" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
          <tr style="background-color:#d9dce1; font-weight:bold;">
            <th align="left">Workshop</th>
            <th align="left">Date</th>
            <th align="left" style="white-space: nowrap;">Format</th>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Mastering Metadata for <br />
            Digital Preservation</td>
            <td>September 5, 2025</td>
            <td>Online</td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="background-color:#f0f0f0;">
            <td>Foundations of Digital Preservation:<br />
            Integrity Checking, Format Migration,<br />
            and Workflows</td>
            <td>TBA October 2025</td>
            <td>Online</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Learning to Work with Legacy Media and <br />
            Forensic Imaging</td>
            <td>TBA November 2025</td>
            <td>In-Person</td>
          </tr>
        </mj-table>

        <mj-text font-weight="bold" font-size="18px" font-family="Roboto" padding-top="16px">
          <br /><br />
          Key Highlights
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Highlight 1 -->
        <mj-text font-family="Roboto" font-size="16px" font-weight="bold" padding-top="16px">ArkFest 2025 Talk</mj-text>
        <mj-text font-family="Roboto">
          Our talk at <a href="https://arkivum.foleon.com/arkfest/arkfest2025/">ArkFest 2025</a> was a success! We shared insights about the history of DPS, the <a href="https://www.dpconline.org/blog/blog-james-baker-25">Critical Cataloguing for Digital Preservation</a> research project, and some lessons from our early partnerships.
          <br /><br />
          Did you miss our talk? You may register to watch a recording <a href="https://events.zoom.us/ev/AmLwazPhpiXZMec1E4IXfoYWe_BfFZWwpCejfHCSJwaiaTUgWFZB~AhAkraZnjGMwj1Pygvfp2heB1WhTj-xutAFoACEhCrCQMTlQzl9w8_2-jg?utm_campaign=13743496-ArkFest%202025&utm_content=338556803&utm_medium=social&utm_source=linkedin&hss_channel=lcp-2046766">at this link.</a>
          <br /><br />
        </mj-text>
        <mj-image src="https://file-paa.zoom.us/D3QEaIe5RTG6ClP4jqUSKQ/Mi4zLqqcn9dU3aJbPCPtKpoYFsvXYXNXYf6FKmAEqSJxvxWJ/ArkFest%20Event%20cover%20page.png?attachType=preview&subType=1920x1920" width="593px" />
        <mj-text font-weight="bold" font-size="18px" font-family="Roboto" padding-top="16px">
        <br /><br />
          Keep an eye out for more updates soon!
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
